        "action_date": "2025-09-26",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Expanding Seniors' Access to PFAS Testing Act</strong></p><p>This bill provides for Medicare coverage of testing for perfluoroalkyl and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) with no cost-sharing. (PFAS are man-made and may have adverse human health effects. A variety of products contain the compounds, such as nonstick cookware or weatherproof clothing.)</p>",
        "update_date": "2026-01-15T22:50:55Z"
      }
